# Converted from the old Grade 2 Survex data (Grade2/Grade2/1Blorenge.svx).

# > Ogof Draenen: Agent Blorenge (part I, off main streamway)
# This data represents a fairly rough compass & tape survey with
# occasional estimated clino readings.
# 
# Survey conducted on Thursday 10th November and 19 November 1994
# by Pete Fracis (SWCC) & friends.
# 
# Data entry: Tim Long
# 

# First surveying trip, 10th Nov 94
# Pete Francis and Toby ?
# N.B. Agent Blorenge is a steep inlet with waterfalls, but this survey data
# does not contain any clino readings.
# 

survey ab1

# Specify units of measurement

# Magnetic North to Grid North correction
# Mag deviation at the time of the readings (9-Oct-94) was
# 4.2 degrees (data from OS sheet 161, 1991).

# Data ordering

survey pf1
# ;; XXX (pod): equate
# ;;*Equate A       \AB.BAC     ; Beyond A Choke 108

centreline
  # BCRA2
  sd length 0.5 metres
  sd compass clino 2.5 degrees
  calibrate compass 4.2
  data normal from to length compass clino
  a	1	4.0	80	0
  1	2	6.8	100	0
  2	3	3.1	105	0
  3	4	2.5	90	0
  4	5	7.4	103	0
